<br class="ltx_break">&lt;tool_response&gt;
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A3.p1.pic1.2.7.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">A Google search for ’citywide nuisance led authorities to convene transit operators Paris year before’ found 10 results:
<br class="ltx_break">Web Results 
<br class="ltx_break">1. [Innovative solutions for sustainable cities]
<br class="ltx_break">(<a href="https://www.ecologie.gouv.fr/sites/default/files/documents/mobility_gb.pdf" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_url ltx_font_typewriter">https://www.ecologie.gouv.fr/sites/default/files/documents/mobility_gb.pdf</a>)
Date published:
From long time, France has built up a tightly-meshed mass transit system, upgraded and adapted to new forms of mobility: coverage of mass transit in the…
<br class="ltx_break">…</span></span></span>
<span id="A3.p1.pic1.2.8" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.p1.pic1.2.8.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">A Google search for ’Paris citywide nuisance transit operators convened’ found 10 results:
<br class="ltx_break">Web Results 
<br class="ltx_break">1. [Electric Rental Scooters to be Banned in Paris …] 
<br class="ltx_break">(<a href="https://www.nytimes.com/2023/04/03/world/europe/paris-electric-scooters-ban.html" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_url ltx_font_typewriter">https://www.nytimes.com/2023/04/03/world/europe/paris-electric-scooters-ban.html</a>)
